{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>באחרית הזעם</b> — He tells of the wrath of HaShem upon Israel in the days of Greece and in the days of Antiochus, until the Hasmoneans purify the Temple, and this is ונצדק קדש. And now he returns to explain, for the first king, who is Alexander, is the horn that was broken speedily, and he explained four kingdoms, and the meaning of מגוי is that all of them were of the Greek nation, and not one among them had power like Alexander."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:29.194848110Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}